      "statement": "The default validator chain runs envelope, format, schema/contract, dependency, semantic, cross-reference, policy, then Package-contributed validators in that order; Package-contributed validators execute only as declarative contracts/rules interpreted by engine-owned validators and never receive engine-core access.",
      "evidence": [
